{"slug":"/references/data-model/property-types/enum","title":"enum Property Method - DML Reference","frontmatter":{"slug":"/references/data-model/property-types/enum","sidebar_label":"enum"},"toc":[{"title":"Example","id":"example","level":2},{"title":"Type Parameters","id":"enum-type-parameters","level":2},{"title":"Parameters","id":"enum-parameters","level":2}],"blocks":[{"kind":"markdown","html":"This method defines a property whose value can only be one of the specified values."},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"Example","id":"example"},{"kind":"markdown","html":"```ts\nimport { model } from \"@medusajs/framework/utils\"\n\nconst MyCustom = model.define(\"my_custom\", {\n  color: model.enum([\"black\", \"white\"]),\n  // ...\n})\n\nexport default MyCustom\n```"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"Type Parameters","id":"enum-type-parameters"},{"kind":"typeList","sectionTitle":"enum","types":[{"name":"Values","type":"`unknown`[] \\| `EnumLike`","description":"The type of possible values. By default, it's `string`.","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]}]},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"Parameters","id":"enum-parameters"},{"kind":"typeList","sectionTitle":"enum","types":[{"name":"values","type":"Values","description":"An array of possible values.","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]}]}]}